# Skill router

Load the matching skill before coding. Skills live in `.cursor/skills/` (also `.claude/skills/`).

| Task | Skill |
|------|-------|
| Ticket status, approve, assign, comments | `barmijly-ticket-workflow` |
| Test suites, cases, bugs (QA surface) | `TEST_SUITES_PLAN.md` + rule `testing-domain` |
| Meetings, minutes, requirements | `MEETINGS_PLAN.md` + rule `meetings-domain` + `barmijly-full-stack-feature` |
| New feature spanning API + UI | `barmijly-full-stack-feature` + rule `feature-standards` |
| New/changed HTTP endpoint | `barmijly-api-sync` |
| Copy this repo's code style | `barmijly-patterns` |
| Prisma schema / migration | `barmijly-prisma-migrate` |
| Bug, 401/403, empty lists | `barmijly-debug` |
| QA accounts / lifecycle test | `barmijly-qa-testing` |
| Review a diff or PR | `barmijly-code-review` |
| Prepare commit / fix pre-commit, lint-staged, husky | `barmijly-prepare-commit` |
| Commit message | `barmijly-commit` |

Uncommitted work: keep a numbered Feature/Update/Removal list in `.cursor/uncommitted.md` (rule `session-tracking`). Clear it after commit.

Post-deploy / backward-compat: append checkboxes to `to_migrate.md` (rule `to-migrate`) for migrate commands, `.env` vars, deploy order, backfills, or any breaking change production will not absorb from a plain code deploy.

Do not paste skill bodies into chat. Read `SKILL.md`, then linked reference files only as needed.

Source of truth: `AGENTS.md` → `req.md` → `backend/GUIDE.md`.
